      "location": "§20",
      "proposalQuote": "TBD as it is T&M",
      "explanation": "Leaving the subcontractor pricing as TBD prevents the State from evaluating the total cost and financial commitment of the proposal.",
      "fix": "Specify the exact dollar figure or rate structure for the subcontractor's work instead of marking it as TBD."
    },
    {
      "type": "VAGUENESS",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "location": "§26",
      "proposalQuote": "may involve further costs, which will be discussed based on the client’s infrastructure and requirements.",
      "explanation": "Deferring pipeline setup costs to future discussions undermines price certainty required by the State standard environment rules.",
      "fix": "Commit to setting up CI/CD pipelines within the baseline cost or state a fixed price rather than deferring costs to future discussions."
    },
    {
      "type": "VAGUENESS",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "location": "§26",
      "proposalQuote": "any potential costs will be discussed based on the scope of the testing needed.",
      "explanation": "Stating that regression testing tool costs will be discussed later creates unexpected budgetary exposure for the client.",
      "fix": "State explicitly whether regression testing tools are included in the baseline bid or specify the exact tool licensing fee."
    }
  ],
